Here are the 2026 personal income tax bands with rates for employees in Nigeria:

- Chargeable income up to NGN 800,000: no tax;
- Next NGN 2,200,000 (total NGN 3,000,000); 15%;
- Next NGN 9,000,000 (total NGN 12,000,000); 18%;
- Next NGN 18,000,000 (total NGN 30,000,000); 21%;
- Chargeable income above NGN 50,000,000; 23%.

The first NGN 800,000 is taxed at 0%; the next NGN 2,200,000 at 15%; the next NGN 9,000,000 at 18%; the next NGN 18,000,000 at 21%; and anything above NGN 50,000,000 at 23%.

